WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Section 3.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:03.825
The Funding Gap.

00:00:03.825 --> 00:00:11.475
Between 2018 and 2023, the government lapsed over 3 billion dollars in approved veterans funding.

00:00:11.475 --> 00:00:17.500
Money was budgeted, but Veterans Affairs simply failed to spend it on the people it was meant for.
